{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [data-destroy]: TRUNCATE in an execution context empties a table. Use DELETE with WHERE for selective removal, or confirm through a migration. [command-sha256:1f14fef9fd8a8c8a2fb1d98ce3e2b5e430252e6e0d4691f7e83e52ab9e93e5f3] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
